2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading near two-year high against dollar\par \par \uc2 * Peru's sol to be boosted by 6-7 pct growth in 2011\par \par \uc2 CHILE WARNS ON PESO, NO \b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  YET [ID:nN30113748]\par \par \uc2 * Chile \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  ups rate 50 bps, eyes on peso\par \par \uc2 * Peso trading around same level that triggered \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in 2008\par \par \uc2 * \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  issues threats but reluctant to act\par \par \uc2 SWITZERLAND HOLDS OFF ON \b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  [ID:nLDE68D1IK]\par \par \uc2 * \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spent nearly 200 bln Swiss francs via \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  from March 2009 but stopped in June this year\par \par \uc2 * Traders speculate \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  move could prompt bank to resume \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 * Swiss franc flirting with parity against dollar\par \par \uc2 RUSSIA BOUGHT DOLLARS AND EUROS IN AUGUST [ID:nLDE68J0KZ]\par \par \uc2 * Trade balance favors stronger rouble\par \par \uc2 * Russia \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought $1.1 bln and 135.6 mln euros in Aug\par \par \uc2 * \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchases foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the MICEX exchange to offset upward pressure on the rouble\par \par \uc2 ROMANIAN \b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  CITED AS LEU FIRMS [ID:nLDE68D0W7]\par \par \uc2 * \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly against both weakening and firming since late 2008\par \par \uc2 SOUTH KOREA SPOTTED BUYING DOLLARS [ID:nTOE66R00T]\par \par \uc2 * Spotted buying small amount of dollars - dealers\par \par \uc2 * Move seen as aimed at keeping won below 1,160 per dollar\par \par \uc2 * Government frequently seen buying dollars this year\par \par \uc2 * \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves post biggest monthly gain in 14 months\par \par \uc2 THAILAND TRYING TO SLOW BAHT GAINS [ID:nSGE68K083]\par \par \uc2 * \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  says no plans for new tools to curb inflows\par \par \uc2 * Could announce measures to encourage outflows\par \par \uc2 * Baht one of Asia's best-performing \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  this year\par \par \uc2 (Writing by Samantha Pearson in Sao Paulo; Editing by Padraic Cassidy)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCIES\b0 \highlight\uc2 -GLOBAL/ (FACTBOX)|LANGEN|ABN|D|E|RBN|M|U|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020100921e69l001b3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
