\par\par \b \uc2 Bank Indonesia Official: BOJ  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Good For Indonesia Budget\b0\par\par\uc2 170 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 September 2010\par 12:20\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--The Bank of Japan's move to weaken the yen is good for the Indonesian budget, Bank Indonesia Deputy Governor Hartadi Sarwono said Friday.\par \par \uc2 "\b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  recently is good for Indonesian budget as we have quite a large amount of yen-denominated debt," Sarwono said without elaborating.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy isn't to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  "at all costs" but only to smooth out volatility.\par \par \uc2 Sarwono added the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will combine instruments to curb inflation and not depend solely on adjusting interest rates.\par \par \uc2 "A rate hike will further attract capital inflows and add more liquidity into the market," Sarwono said.\par \par \uc2 Bank Indonesia Governor Darmin Nasution said a rate hike will be counterproductive for the current economy, a further sign that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  prefers to keep the rate unchanged as long as possible.\par \par \uc2 -By I-Made Sentana, Dow Jones Newswires; 62 21 39831277; andreasismar.sandiwan@dowjones.com [ 17-09-10 1041GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020100917e69h000qc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
