\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE: BOJ Leaves Some  \highlight22\uc2 FX Intervention \highlight\uc2  Funds In Market\b0\par\par\uc2 By Megumi Fujikawa and Hiroshi Miwa   \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES   \par \uc2 240 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 September 2010\par 03:09\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 TOKYO (Dow Jones)--The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  skipped its Thursday morning money market \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2 , refraining--as expected--from draining any funds from the market, in a sign that it's not at this point sterilizing the yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the government that moved aggressively Wednesday to weaken the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The focus will now shift to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's 0400 GMT money market \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  for further indications of the BOJ's intentions.\par \par \uc2 The Japanese government has turned up the heat on the BOJ to cooperate with its efforts to combat the strong yen and the grinding deflation that is crippling the economy. Along those lines, it wants the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to leave the yen that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Wednesday--estimated by market participants at roughly a whopping Y2 trillion--in the market.\par \par \uc2 Some analysts say leaving the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  unsterilized would make the MOF's \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  more effective in pushing down the yen, which had soared to a 15-year high against the dollar Wednesday before the finance ministry stepped into the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market for the first time in more than six years.\par \par \uc2 By Megumi Fujikawa and Hiroshi Miwa, Dow Jones Newswires; +81-3-6269-2786; megumi.fujikawa@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (Arran Scott contributed to this article.) [ 16-09-10 0109GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020100916e69g0002b\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
